{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02857","headline":"王师渡汉水经襄阳 · 李百药","name":"王师渡汉水经襄阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"导漾疏源远，归海会流长。\n延波接荆梦，通望迩沮漳。\n高岸沈碑影，曲漵丽珠光。\n云昏翠岛没，水广素涛扬。\n阅川已多叹，遐睇几增伤。\n临谿犹驻马，望岘欲沾裳。\n乔木下寒叶，亭林落晓霜。\n山公不可遇，谁与访高阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}